    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"PropertyMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper</code></a> instance that applies the given\n<a href=\"PropertyMapper.SourceOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.SourceOperator</code></a> to every source.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper</code></a> 实例，该实例将给定的 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.SourceOperator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.SourceOperator</code></a> 应用于每个源。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a> from the specified value that can be used to perform\nthe mapping.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a>，该对象可从指定的值创建，并可用于执行映射。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a> from the specified value supplier that can be used to\nperform the mapping.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a>，该对象可从指定的值供应器中获取，并可用于执行映射。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a> that can be used to complete the mapping",
      "translation": "一个可用于完成映射的<a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.properties\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the property mapper.",
      "translation": "返回属性映射器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Mappings can ultimately be applied to a <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#to(java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>setter</code></a>, trigger a\n<a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#toCall(java.lang.Runnable)\"><code>method call</code></a> or create a\n<a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#toInstance(java.util.function.Function)\"><code>new instance</code></a>.",
      "translation": "映射最终可以应用于 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#to(java.util.function.Consumer)\"><code>setter</code></a>，触发一个 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#toCall(java.lang.Runnable)\"><code>方法调用</code></a> 或创建一个 <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#toInstance(java.util.function.Function)\"><code>新实例</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default <code>null</code> values and any <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/NullPointerException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>NullPointerException</code></a> thrown from the\nsupplier are filtered and will not be applied to consumers. If you want to apply nulls,\nyou can use <a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#always()\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source.always()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，<code>null</code> 值以及由供应者抛出的任何<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/NullPointerException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>NullPointerException</code></a>都会被过滤掉，不会应用到消费者。如果您希望应用 null 值，可以使用<a href=\"PropertyMapper.Source.html#always()\"><code>PropertyMapper.Source.always()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Can filter values based on predicates and adapt values if needed. For example:",
      "translation": "可以根据谓词过滤值，并在需要时调整这些值。例如：",
      "count": 2
    },
